[ti:Dynamite]
[ar:EdgarAllanMusic]
[al:EcceH.text (Revalued)]
[00:38.96]Some day my name will smell of thunder
[00:42.35]A crisis written in a quiet hand
[00:46.23]I don't want followers, I don't take vows
[00:50.14]I'd only have to wash my hands
[00:54.20]I'm too full of mischief to believe
[00:57.68]Even in the man inside these clothes
[01:01.64]I smelled the lie before you told it
[01:04.90]All my genius lives in my nose
[01:09.93]I contradict like no one ever has
[01:13.08]And still I am the biggest yes
[01:17.42]I am not a man, I am dynamite
[01:20.77]And the fuse is made of laughter
[01:25.05]Don't you ever call me holy
[01:28.26]I'm the clown who's coming after
[01:47.52]Tap an idol with a hammer, hear the hollow ring
[01:49.75]A thousand years of lying wore the crown of truth
[01:51.73]I'm the bringer of a joy that never had a name
[01:53.42]And the mountains and the valleys swap their views
[01:55.64]I don't want a temple, I don't want a shrine
[01:57.50]I'm writing this before they try
[01:59.30]The first decent man was a scandal in his time
[02:01.41]I'd rather be ridiculous than lie
[02:03.72]I contradict like no one ever has
[02:06.93]And still I am the biggest yes
[02:11.39]I am not a man, I am dynamite
[02:14.68]And the fuse is made of laughter
[02:18.87]Don't you ever make me holy
[02:21.95]Hang the halo on the rafters
[02:28.61]Don't make me holy. Please
[02:36.33]Don't make me holy. Please
[02:44.04]Don't make me holy. Please
[02:45.86]I am not a man, I am dynamite
[02:49.09]And the fuse is made of laughter
[02:52.28]I said no to every idol
[02:56.00]Just to say yes to what comes after
[03:34.39]I am not a man... I am dynamite
[03:39.36]They wanted a saint. I'd rather be a clown
[03:43.94]Maybe I am a clown
[03:45.89]But a clown who brings good news
[03:48.69]A harbinger of joy like none before
[03:52.53]The mountains and the valleys swap their places
[03:55.90]And the idols fall without a sound
[04:00.56]Have you understood me?
[04:02.59]Dionysus... versus the Crucified
[04:05.77]
